Two camss fixes found while bringing up the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q):
avoid calling s_stream twice through a forwarding subdev, and follow the
enabled link when finding the sensor.

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

Miroslav Mraz (2):
  media: qcom: camss: Don't call s_stream twice through a forwarding
    subdev
  media: qcom: camss: Follow the enabled link when finding the sensor

